    <string name="welcome_1">Put the phone down and sit still. The longer and quieter you sit, the bolder the forest gets.</string>
    <string name="welcome_2">After two weeks one animal steps out and stays: your guardian, chosen by how you practise.</string>
    <string name="welcome_3">Every minute counts: a lake, a mountain meadow and the sea open along the way, each with animals of its own.</string>
    <string name="welcome_pick">What do you practise?</string>
    <string name="welcome_pick_sub">Pick a few. You can rename them and add your own later.</string>
    <string name="welcome_enter">Into the forest</string>

